  {"type":"text","x":1.167,"y":0.5,"w":6.778,"h":0.278,"text":"A Decade of Rain","family":"Geist","style":"SemiBold","sizePt":20,"lineHeight":1.02,"letterSpacing":0.06,"transform":"uppercase","align":"left","color":"#213528","resize":"HEIGHT"},
  {"type":"text","x":1.167,"y":0.889,"w":6.778,"h":0.278,"text":"An interactive map of Agent Orange over South Vietnam, 1961–1971","family":"Geist","style":"Regular","sizePt":16,"lineHeight":1.25,"letterSpacing":0,"transform":"none","align":"left","color":"#213528","resize":"WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT"},
  {"type":"image","x":0.333,"y":1.5,"w":10.333,"h":10.597,"name":"atlas-flat-square.png","framed":true,"strokeColor":"#dfe3d9","strokeWeight":1},
  {"type":"text","x":0.333,"y":12.264,"w":10.333,"h":0.461,"text":"Between 1961 and 1971 the United States sprayed nearly 20 million gallons of herbicide over the forests, mangroves and croplands of South Vietnam. This site draws where it fell, run by run, from the HERBS file: the U.S. military’s own record of every mission.","family":"Geist","style":"Regular","sizePt":12,"lineHeight":1.58,"letterSpacing":0,"transform":"none","align":"left","color":"#213528","resize":"NONE"},
  {"type":"svg","name":"qr","x":8.667,"y":13.391,"w":2,"h":2},
  {"type":"text","x":0.339,"y":13.391,"w":0.833,"h":0.208,"text":"THE STORY","family":"Geist","style":"SemiBold","sizePt":10,"lineHeight":1.5,"letterSpacing":0.08,"transform":"uppercase","align":"left","color":"#213528","resize":"WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT"},
  {"type":"text","x":0.339,"y":13.671,"w":3.314,"h":0.578,"text":"A scroll-driven narrative in eight chapters, from the 1961 test sprays to the 1971 reckoning, over one heat field that fills in as you read.","family":"Geist","style":"Regular","sizePt":10,"lineHeight":1.5,"letterSpacing":0,"transform":"none","align":"left","color":"#4e6355","resize":"NONE"},
  {"type":"text","x":3.939,"y":13.391,"w":0.819,"h":0.208,"text":"THE ATLAS","family":"Geist","style":"SemiBold","sizePt":10,"lineHeight":1.5,"letterSpacing":0.08,"transform":"uppercase","align":"left","color":"#213528","resize":"WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT"},
  {"type":"text","x":3.939,"y":13.671,"w":3.314,"h":0.578,"text":"Every mission in the record: a playable decade, flight tracks weighted by gallons per kilometre, and a lookup by place or by HERBS mission number.","family":"Geist","style":"Regular","sizePt":10,"lineHeight":1.5,"letterSpacing":0,"transform":"none","align":"left","color":"#4e6355","resize":"NONE"},
  {"type":"text","x":0.339,"y":14.725,"w":0.611,"h":0.208,"text":"19.5M","family":"Geist","style":"SemiBold","sizePt":14,"lineHeight":1.05,"letterSpacing":0.06,"transform":"none","align":"left","color":"#cf3720","resize":"HEIGHT"},
